{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't stand your chopsticks|in the rice."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Funeral food.|Not lunch."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same hands.|Lay them flat."},{"id":"s5","text":"On the rest.|Bowl in hand."},{"id":"s6","text":"She pointed—"},{"id":"s7","text":"They keep eating.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Chopsticks flat,|rice gone."},{"id":"s9","text":"Flat, not standing.|That's the rule."},{"id":"n1","text":"Upright chopsticks|mean a funeral."},{"id":"n2","text":"Lay them flat|on the rest."},{"id":"n3","text":"Bowl in hand.|Eat like this."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}